{"id":"supuesto","lemma":"supuesto","pos":"adj","rank":214,"glosses":["supposed, self-styled, alleged"],"ipa":"/suˈpwesto/","forms":{"feminine":"supuesta","masculinePlural":"supuestos","femininePlural":"supuestas"},"examples":[{"text":"\"¿Puedo ir contigo?\" \"Por supuesto.\"","en":"\"May I go with you?\" \"Of course.\"","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/684340","words":[{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to go"},{"g":"with you"},{"g":"for / by"},null]},{"text":"Di por supuesto que ella vendría.","en":"I took it for granted that she would come.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/932164","words":[{"g":"Used as a friendly…"},{"g":"for / by"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"she"},{"g":"to come","l":"venir"}]},{"text":"Por supuesto, él tiene razón.","en":"Of course, he is right.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/35342","words":[{"g":"for / by"},null,{"g":"he"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"reason"}]},{"text":"Por supuesto que voy a hacer eso.","en":"Of course, I'm going to do that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1155852","words":[{"g":"for / by"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"that","l":"ése"}]},{"text":"Por supuesto que no es verdad.","en":"Of course it isn't true.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/519694","words":[{"g":"for / by"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"truth"}]}]}